  <iati-identifier>XM-DAC-7-PPR-4000002447</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-7" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Netherlands</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Policy costs Fonds Verantwoord Ondernemen (Corporate Responsibility Fund)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the fund to be set up, risks in the area of human rights, labour and the environment in the chains of Dutch companies in developing countries can be tackled, in collaboration with their local partners and civil society organisations. The fund does this by supporting the implementation phase of the IMVO (CSO) covenants and - when there is no IMVO (CSO) covenant (yet) in the sector concerned - by offering support to companies that want to investigate and tackle abuses in their chain.</narrative>
  </description>
